#| "will be taken into consideration as both values (ie: bottom/top) will "
#| "need to be equal to\n"
#| "keep the dot centered)<br>\n"
#| "* if data source is not GPS location, the centering will only be done for "
#| "horizontal axis\n"
#| "(time), vertical axis crop will behave just like for the basic 2D map "
#| "line (it will statically keep\n"
#| "the same min/max limit allowing the Now dot to move up and down).]]>"
msgid ""
"<b>Speedometer</b> is available for all data sources but recommended only "
"for speed; for the map type it represents the \"percentage done\" from "
"trimmed start - end).<br>\n"
"Note: for type 1 (zoom and center, aka \"follow the dot\"):<br>\n"
"* crop values are only valid as a percentage and only the bottom (resp left) "
"values\n"
"will be taken into consideration as both values (ie: bottom/top) will need "
"to be equal to\n"
"keep the dot centered)<br>\n"
"* if data source is not GPS location, the centering will only be done for "
"horizontal axis\n"
"(time), vertical axis crop will behave just like for the basic 2D map line "
"(it will statically keep\n"
"the same min/max limit allowing the Now dot to move up and down)."
msgstr ""
"<![CDATA[<b>Abiadura-neurgailua</b> datu-sorburu guztietarako erabilgarri "
"dago, abiadurarako bakarrik gomendatzen da ordea; ordezkatzen duen mapa "
"motarako \"egindako ehunekoa\" irudikatzen du, kimatutako hasieratik- "
"bukaeratik).<br>\n"
"Oharra: 1 motarako (zooma eta erdiratu, \"puntuari jarraitu\" gisa ere "
"ezaguna:<br>\n"
"* mozketa balioak ehuneko gisa baino ez dute balio eta beheko balioak "
"bakarrik\n"
"hartuko dira kontuan, puntua erdiratuta mantentzeko bi balioak (adib: "
"behekoa/goikoa)\n"
"berdinak izan behar baitira.<br>\n"
"* datuen sorburua GPS kokapena ez bada, erdiratzea ardatz horizontalean "
"bakarrik egingo da\n"
"(denbora), ardatz bertikalaren mozketa 2Dko oinarrizko mapa-lerrorako bezala "
"jokatuko du (min/max muga bera estatikoki mantenduko du Orain puntuari\n"
"goraka eta beheraka mugitzen utziz).]]>"

