msgid "Adjust the audio pitch using the Rubberband library."
msgstr "Doitu audio tonua Ruberband liburutegia erabiliz."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/rboctaveshift.xml
#: rc.cpp:1680
#, kde-format
msgid "Octave Shift"
msgstr "Zortzidun Aldaketa"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/rboctaveshift.xml
#: rc.cpp:1682
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The octave shift. This is the octave shift of the source frequency. For "
"example, a shift of +1 would double the frequency; -1 would halve the "
"frequency and 0 would leave the pitch unaffected. To put this in frequency "
"terms, a frequency shift f (where f greater than one for upwards shift and "
"less than one for downwards) is: o = log(f) / log(2). Ignored if pitchscale "
"is set."
msgstr ""
"Zortzidunaren aldaketa. Jatorrizko maiztasunaren zortzidunaren aldaketa da. "
"Adibidez, +1 aldaketak maiztasuna bikoiztuko luke; -1 aldaketak erdira "
"murriztuko luke maiztasuna eta 0 balioak ez luke tonua aldatuko. Maiztasun "
"lengoaiara ekarriz , f maiztasun aldaketa (non f bat baino handiagoa den "
"igoeran eta bat baino txikiagoa den jaitsieran) honakoa da: o = log(f) / "
"log(2). Ez ikusiaren egingo da tonu-eskala gaitua dagoenean."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/rboctaveshift.xml
#. i18n: file: data/effects/rbpitchscale.xml
#: rc.cpp:1684 rc.cpp:1700
#, kde-format
msgid "Stretch"
msgstr "Luzatu"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/rboctaveshift.xml
#. i18n: file: data/effects/rbpitchscale.xml
#: rc.cpp:1686 rc.cpp:1702
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Stretch the audio to fill the requested samples. This option will have no "
"effect if the requested sample size is the same as the received sample size."
msgstr ""
"Luzatu audioa eskatutako laginak betetzeko. Aukera honek ez du eraginik "
"izango baldin eta lagin tamaina jasotako lagin tamainaren berdina bada."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/rboctaveshift.xml
#. i18n: file: data/effects/rbpitchscale.xml
#: rc.cpp:1688 rc.cpp:1704
#, kde-format
msgid "Latency"
msgstr "Latentzia"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/rboctaveshift.xml
#. i18n: file: data/effects/rbpitchscale.xml
#: rc.cpp:1690 rc.cpp:1706
#, kde-format
msgid "The amount of delay for each sample from the input to the output."
msgstr "Lagin bakoitzeko atzerapen kopurua sarreratik irteerara."

#. i18n: file: data/effects/rbpitchscale.xml
#: rc.cpp:1692
#, kde-format
msgid "Rubberband Pitch Scale"
msgstr "Rubberband Tonu eskalatzailea"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/rbpitchscale.xml
#: rc.cpp:1696
#, kde-format
msgid "Pitch Scale"
msgstr "Tonu Eskala"

#. i18n: file: data/effects/rbpitchscale.xml
#: rc.cpp:1698
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The pitch scaling ratio. This is the ratio of target frequency to source "
"frequency. For example, a ratio of 2.0 would shift up by one octave; 0.5 "
"down by one octave; or 1.0 leave the pitch unaffected. To put this in "
"musical terms, a pitch scaling ratio corresponding to a shift of o octaves "
"(where o is positive for an upwards shift and negative for downwards) is: f "
"= pow(2.0, o). Overrides octaveshift."
msgstr ""
"Tonuaren eskala ratioa. Hau da, helburu-maiztasunaren ratioa  jatorri-"
