msgid ""
"Determines how the effect tries to adapt to background changes. <br/>\n"
"            The Light Graffiti effect remembers the first frame of the clip "
"it is applied to, so the clip should <em>always</em> start with the painter "
"outside of the video. If the background constantly changes, e.g. on a "
"street, try to set α > 0 to calculate an average background image."
msgstr ""
"<![CDATA[Efektua atzeko-planoko aldaketetara nola egokitzen den zehazten du. "
"<br/>\n"
"            Argi grafiti efektuak aplikatu den kliparen lehenengo fotograma "
"gogoratzen du; beraz, klipak margotzeko tresna <em>beti</em> bideotik kanpo "
"duela hasi beharko du` . Atzeko-planoa etengabe aldatzen bada, adibidez kale "
"batean, saiatu α > 0 finkatzen bataz-besteko atzeko-plano bat kalkulatzeko]]>"

